# Environment configuration for Kitchen 3D Studio
# Firebase AI Logic (Gemini API) uses Firebase App Check for zero-trust attestation.
# Google Sign-In web client ID (OAuth client from Firebase console:
# Project settings -> General -> Your apps -> Web client ID).
# The repo has no google-services.json, so the app reads this BuildConfig
# value instead of R.string.default_web_client_id. Keep the placeholder
# "not-configured" to build without Google Sign-In (the app skips sign-in
# gracefully for that value). To enable Google Sign-In, replace it with
# your real OAuth web client ID from the Firebase console.
# NOTE: an empty value breaks the build — the Secrets plugin generates
# `DEFAULT_WEB_CLIENT_ID = ;` (unquoted) for empty properties.
DEFAULT_WEB_CLIENT_ID=not-configured
